<article class="partner-card pick-card">
          <object class="pick-photo" data="assets/images/tailgateladder.png" type="image/jpeg"
            aria-label="Tailgate Ladder">
          </object>

          <div class="partner-body">
            <p class="tag">Truck and Tow Vehicle Gear</p>
            <h2>TraXion Tailgate Ladder XL</h2>
            <p>A fold-away ladder for getting into a pickup bed. The XL model has a pivoting frame designed to adjust to
              uneven ground.</p>

            <aside aria-labelledby="tailgate-ladder-take" class="pick-assessment">
              <h3 id="tailgate-ladder-take">Jerry&#x2019;s take</h3>
              <p>
                I'm not as young as I used to be. Hopping in and out of the truck bed isn't quite as easy as it was
                years ago. This ladder is
                always at your fingertips when you need to climb in or out of the bed. Plus our grandkids love climbing
                on it... It installs with a few sheet metal screws, and has a strap to
                hold it in place against the inside of the tailgate for travel.
              </p>
            </aside>

            <a target="_amazon" class="button button-dark" href="https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0CKGB9TSN">View on
              Amazon</a>
